CCTPBridgeModule_EstimateOutput
├── when params length is less than 32 bytes
│   └── it should return (0, token)
├── when domain is not configured
│   └── it should return (0, token)
├── when maxFee is greater than or equal to amount
│   └── it should return (0, token)
└── when all checks pass
    └── it should return (amount - maxFee, token)
